  "id": "ex12-erlangmon-saneiketsu-invitation-trap",
  "title": "Examon vs Saiyu Warriors: Suspend Kotenken Token with BT20 Groundramon Instead of Triggering EX12 Erlangmon + Saneiketsu Invitation Trap",
  "description": "Examon (Seat 1) enters Turn 4 Main at 5 memory after promoting EX13-018 Coredramon from breeding, holding BT1-094 Oblivion Bird and BT20-042 Groundramon against 0 opponent security. Saiyu Warriors (Seat 2) controls suspended EX12-034 Erlangmon (with Lv.5 [SW] EX12-015 Gokuumon in its digivolution cards), unsuspended 9000 DP [Kotenken] Blocker Token, armed EX12-071 Saneiketsu Invitation <Delay>, and EX12-019 Nezhamon (Lv.6 [Saneiketsu] Blocker) in hand. Deleting [Kotenken] Token with BT1-094 Oblivion Bird springs EX12-034's WhenWouldLeave interrupt to free-play EX12-015 Gokuumon from sources, which triggers EX12-034's [All Turns] bottom-deck bounce of Coredramon AND EX12-071's <Delay> free digivolve into unsuspended EX12-019 Nezhamon. Digivolving BT20-042 Groundramon onto Coredramon for 3 memory suspends [Kotenken] Token without removing it from the battle area and attacks for immediate lethal.",
